<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#f7f7f5">
    <title>About | Book World</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4"></script>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            color: #26332a;
            background: #f7f7f5;
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
        }

        .about-page { width: min(860px, calc(100% - 32px)); margin: 56px auto 72px; }
        .about-card { padding: clamp(26px, 6vw, 54px); border: 1px solid #e3e6df; border-radius: 12px; background: #fff; }
        .about-label { margin: 0 0 12px; color: #59725e; font-size: .78rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; }
        .about-card h1 { margin: 0; font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif; font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem); font-weight: 500; }
        .about-intro { max-width: 650px; margin: 18px 0 0; color: #59635b; font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8; }
        .about-details { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 24px; margin-top: 34px; padding-top: 26px; border-top: 1px solid #e8ebe5; }
        .about-details h2 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 1rem; }
        .about-details p { margin: 0; color: #69716b; line-height: 1.7; }
        .about-links { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; margin-top: 30px; }
        .about-link { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 42px; padding: 0 16px; border: 1px solid #314c37; border-radius: 7px; color: #fff; background: #314c37; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; transition: background .18s ease, transform .18s ease; }
        .about-link:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); background: #243b2a; }
        .about-link.secondary { color: #314c37; background: #fff; }
        .about-link.secondary:hover { background: #f1f4ef; }

        @media (max-width: 560px) {
            .about-page { margin: 30px auto 48px; }
            .about-details { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 18px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <%- include('includes/nav.ejs') %>
    <main class="about-page">
        <section class="about-card">
            <p class="about-label">About us</p>
            <h1>Welcome to Book World</h1>
            <p class="about-intro">
                Book World is a place to explore stories, discover different topics, and find your next book.
                Browse our collection by title or category, and choose a read that interests you.
            </p>
            <div class="about-details">
                <div>
                    <h2>Explore the collection</h2>
                    <p>Find books across a range of categories and browse the details of each title.</p>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h2>Find your next read</h2>
                    <p>Whether you have a favorite subject or want to try something new, there is a shelf to start with.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="about-links">
                <a class="about-link" href="/books">Browse books</a>
                <a class="about-link secondary" href="/category">View categories</a>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>
    <%- include('includes/footer.ejs') %>
</body>
</html>
